# .slapignore: the files SLAP leaves out of a commit's size (kirunak R21). Patterns as in .gitignore, from
# this folder; a file deleted whole is always left out. Only the owner changes this file: they edit it and type
# `k slapignore approve <repo>` (R23).

# Lock files
*.lock
package-lock.json
npm-shrinkwrap.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
Package.resolved
gradle.lockfile

# Build output
build/
dist/

# Minified files and source maps
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map

# Prose
*.md
*.mdx
*.markdown
*.txt
*.rst
*.adoc

# Tables
*.tsv
*.csv

# Binary files this repo tracks
*.gif
*.mp4
*.png
